  "note": "Runs a short list of large MoE models from its own packs and keeps their experts in RAM. Packs from ISTA-DASLab, Unsloth and agentionai are ordinary GGUFs, so llama.cpp loads most of them too, but needs more memory. Since 0.2.11 it also runs seven of Unsloth's re-uploaded Qwen3.8-Flash-Next files, UD-IQ1_M to UD-IQ4_XS-v31, whose memory needs its docs do not give yet."
}
